.Dd September 27, 2026
.Dt MIROTALK 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mirotalk
.Nd MiroTalk SFU video conferencing service
.Sh DESCRIPTION
This installation of MiroTalk SFU was built using the STANDARD build option.
It uses the standard MiroTalk configuration and build except for changes required to package and operate MiroTalk on FreeBSD.
To build the customizable and privacy-hardened version, select the HARDENED build option when configuring the port, then rebuild and reinstall it.
.Pp
The STANDARD build uses the upstream MiroTalk configuration files
.Pa %%WWWDIR%%/.env
and
.Pa %%WWWDIR%%/app/src/config.js .
.Sh SERVICE
Enable the service in
.Pa /etc/rc.conf
or
.Pa /etc/rc.conf.local :
.Bd -literal -offset indent
mirotalk_enable="YES"
.Ed
.Pp
Control the service with
.Xr service 8 .
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "%%WWWDIR%%/app/src/config.js" -compact
.It Pa %%WWWDIR%%/.env
Upstream environment configuration.
.It Pa %%WWWDIR%%/app/src/config.js
Upstream application configuration.
.It Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/rc.d/mirotalk
FreeBSD service script.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr rc.conf 5 ,
.Xr service 8
